	<<refuseicon>><<link [[거절한다|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>

<<else>>

	"건방진 놈." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "사라져."
	<br><br>

	<<dooricon "danube">><<link [[다른 집을 두드려본다 (0:02)|Danube House Knock]]>><<endevent>><<pass 2>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<getouticon>><<link [[그만둔다|Danube Street]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
